  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components and autoclave. Aseptically add per liter the following solutions from sterile stocks (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Check final pH to be 6.0-6.5. Dispense into culture vessels, replace the gas phase with a N2-CO2-O2 (79:20:1, v/v/v) gas mixture, and seal with butyl rubber stoppers."
    }
  ]
